It's not a short.
One of the ornaments
is touching the sockets.

1056
00:58:02,938 --> 00:58:05,523
Fine.

1057
00:58:05,607 --> 00:58:07,775
You take care of it, Oliver.

1058
00:58:12,239 --> 00:58:14,490
Come on,
it's Christmas time.

1059
00:58:14,575 --> 00:58:16,534
Let's get festive.

1060
00:58:16,618 --> 00:58:18,536
I have to go out.

1061
00:58:18,620 --> 00:58:21,455
I got stuff I got to
do in my room.

1062
